  "$comment": "NEW. The complete French interface, in three channels at once. EVERY key carries `t` (written), `a` (spoken clip id) and `i` (icon id). A key with a null icon or a missing clip is a lint failure, not a style choice: the learner cannot read `t`, so `a` and `i` are not decoration, they are the interface. Keys with an empty string and a `ctx` note are deliberately empty — read the note before filling one in.",
  "principle": "text + icon + voice, always all three",
  "register": {
    "address": "tutoiement",
    "tone": "adulte, chaleureux, jamais enfantin",
    "maxWords": 12,
    "noJargon": true
  },
